## Complete Execution Flow Summary

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant V as fall.mp4
    participant CV as OpenCV
    participant Y as YOLOv8s Model
    participant L as Fall Logic
    participant D as Display Window

    loop Every Frame
        V->>CV: Read frame
        CV->>CV: Resize to 980×740
        CV->>Y: Send frame for inference
        Y->>CV: Return bounding boxes + classes + confidence
        loop Each Detection
            CV->>L: Check if person & conf > 80%
            L->>L: Compare height vs width
            alt height < width
                L->>D: Draw "Fall Detected" 🚨
            else height ≥ width
                L->>D: Draw bounding box ✅
            end
        end
        CV->>D: Show annotated frame
        D->>D: Wait for 't' keypress to exit
    end
```

---

## Technology Stack Summary

| Layer | Technology | Role |
|---|---|---|
| **Deep Learning** | PyTorch + YOLOv8 | Object detection neural network |
| **Computer Vision** | OpenCV | Video I/O, frame processing, display |
| **Visualization** | cvzone | Pretty bounding boxes and text labels |
| **Model** | YOLOv8s (COCO) | Pre-trained on 80 common object classes |
| **Language** | Python | Scripting and orchestration |
